 result←object bitmap arg;stylebits;pxsize;isize;tunits;pic;cbits;psize;bkg;px
⍝ May be a file name or a pixel array
⍝ We store the value they gave us in the local variable (file name or pixel matrix), but this will not be modified by later
⍝ operations that affect 'image' directly. Nor is an original array here modified by style or imagesize (they just change the final image).

 :If 0=≢arg
     result←object ⎕VGET⊂'_bitmap' ''
     :Return
 :EndIf

 (stylebits isize psize)←object ⎕VGET('_style' 0)('_imagesize'⍬)('_size'⍬)
 stylebits←##.##.BitVals stylebits
 :If 0=≢isize ⋄ isize←psize ⋄ :EndIf
 bkg←256⊥⌽⊃object ⎕VGET⊂'_color_'((3⍴240)⍬) ⍝ Background color to use
 tunits←⊃##._supp.MyUnits object
 pic←⎕VGET object⍕⍛,'._pic' ⍝ The Bitmap child will always exist
 px←⌊0.5+isize×tunits ⍝ How big is the Picture (in pixels)?
 :If ##.##.IsChar arg←##.##.Single arg ⍝ This is for processing file names
     '∆WI RANK ERROR: bitmap'##.##.Error 1<≢⍴arg
     :If 0=≢arg ⍝ We're resetting it back to background-only
         object._bitmap←''
         cbits←px⍴bkg

     :ElseIf '.bmp'≡⍥⎕C ¯4↑arg ⍝ APL+Win only accepts .BMP files
     :AndIf ⎕NEXISTS arg ⍝ If it's not an existing file, don't change the bitmapsize or image/imagesize
         object._bitmap←arg
         pxsize←⍴cbits←pic _supp.ReadBMP arg ⍝ Build our base pixel-image from their file
         cbits←pic _supp.AlignPic cbits stylebits px ⍝ Align declared image within whole Picture
         object._bitmapsize←pxsize÷tunits
     :EndIf

 :ElseIf ##.##.IsInt arg ⍝ This is for processing direct pixel-source images
     object._bitmap←arg
     :If 2≥≢⍴arg ⍝ Is it a matrix or can it be coerced into one? ⍝? Should this instead just truncate to 2 dimensions?
         arg←arg⍴⍨¯2↑1 1,⍴arg ⍝ Force to be a matrix
         pxsize←⍴arg ⍝ How big is the bitmap (in pixels)?
         object._bitmapsize←pxsize÷tunits
         arg←256⊥⊖(3⍴256)⊤arg ⍝ Convert APL+Win ⊥BGR form into Dyalog ⊥RGB form (throw away overflows/wraparounds)
         cbits←pic _supp.AlignPic arg stylebits px ⍝ Align declared image within whole Picture
     :EndIf

 :Else
     ##.##.Error'∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: bitmap'
 :EndIf

 pic ##.##.∆WS⊂'CBits'cbits ⍝ Directly specify the pixels to be displayed
 result←##.NoRes
